  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Artisanal Small Scale Gold Miners in Eastern DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to increase Eastern DRC artisanal and small scale gold mining (ASGM) communities usage of mercury free gold production techniques and further the DRC&apos;s progress towards ratification of the Minamata Convention.</narrative>
